      ],
      "title": "晚宴·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23419001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "小可爱们……都逃掉了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "嗯？原来比赛已经结束了吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "托你的福！！克罗赛尔也逃掉了！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "看来我应该要说抱歉？我实在没办法狠心冲开那些可爱小家伙的阻拦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "哼……谁知道你这女人，到底是不是故意的，在这种关头犯蠢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "这笔账我们之后再算，所有人跟我走，继续抓捕克罗赛尔！扩大搜捕网络。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "管理局手办",
          "text": "是……大人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "伊迪丝小姐，你没事吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "谢谢「|103|」|101|关心，刚才让您见笑了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看来事情还算完美的结束了，虽然没有抓住克罗赛尔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "是的，这都要感谢「|103|」|101|的帮助，如果没有你，也没法让我准备好如此有利的局面。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "正好麻烦的家伙也都离开了，接下来……请允许我用我的方式来表达对您的感谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "23419014",
              "text": "感谢，是指……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "23419013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "「|103|」|101|，不知道我是否有荣幸邀请您共舞一曲。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "23419016",
              "text": "共……共舞？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "23419015",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "「|103|」|101|，是在害羞吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我……没跟手办跳过舞！是……紧张！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "没关系，如果感到紧张的话，您可以先闭上眼睛，我们可以慢慢来调整。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "现在伸手出来吧，我就在您前方。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "23419021",
              "text": "感受到你了，伊迪丝。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "23419020",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "您的状态不错，像位野心勃勃的新兵。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23419022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "现在，请睁开眼睛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-539",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "edith",
          "rowIds": [
            23419001,
            23419002,
